  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/a4g/data-shape#epo-AgentInRoleShape">
    <rdfs:comment>Relative concept that ties an Agent to a part they play in a given Situational Context. Additional information: The classification of roles is based is based on the degree of involvement into the Procurement Process: - Primary (Procurement) Pole is directly involved in the Procurement Process; - Secondary (Procurement sub-) Role is secondary to the Procurement Process - Tertiary (Related) Role is not involved in the Procurement Process.</rdfs:comment>
