    <sh:path rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasApproximateFrameworkAgreementValue"/>
    <sh:description>The estimated value to be spent within the Framework Agreement(s). Additional information: In the case of an Award Decision for a Lot, this relation represents the estimated value for the awarded Framework Agreement. In the case of a Notice, this relation represents the estimated value for all Framework Agreements covered by the Notice.</sh:description>
