    <sh:description>The expected payments made by the buyer to the economic operator awarded the concession that are not directly related to the use of the concession. &lt;u&gt;Additional Information:&lt;/u&gt; For example the public buyer pays a yearly fee to provide a ticketing solution to the public. The fee the public pays for every ticket sold through the solution is not included in this estimation but in the estimation of the user concession revenue.</sh:description>
